Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">谷歌DeepMind CEO哈萨比斯预测AGI最快将于2029至2030年间实现</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软拟于下周Build大会发布全新自研代码及多场景AI模型</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">三菱日联金融集团向3.5万名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise并开启AI原生转型</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿里云百炼全面CLI化并开源，一行命令实现AI Agent全栈能力编排</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/9cd3b8616edb03050c7b7597a596ef01.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿里云百炼于2026年5月29日宣布全面CLI化并正式开源，旨在通过轻量化命令行工具实现AI Agent全栈能力的一体化编排。开发者安装并配置鉴权后，仅需一行命令即可在Claude Code、Qoder、Qwen Code、OpenClaw及Hermes Agent等主流框架中调用百炼平台能力。该CLI工具将模型调用、应用工作流、知识库检索、长期记忆管理、联网搜索及本地多模态处理等核心功能统一封装，解决了以往多点对接API、鉴权复杂及参数结构不统一的行业痛点。通过此工具，Agent能够高效协同跨模态任务，并将实时联网信息与企业知识库深度融合，构建具备业务深度的智能助手。目前，官方GitHub仓库已上线，并收录20余个专家Skills及Showcase项目。此举显著降低了复杂任务流的构建门槛，对加速大模型应用生态</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">阿波罗与黑石筹资360亿美元，通过租赁模式为Anthropic采购谷歌TPU</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6125686a72adff615a40c0379ea677c4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">阿波罗全球管理公司与黑石集团正联合发起一项规模约360亿美元的债务融资交易，旨在为AI独角兽Anthropic构建人工智能基础设施。该交易采取“以租代买”模式，专项用于购买谷歌定制化AI芯片TPU，交付后由Anthropic租用以获取算力。博通公司为该交易中规模最大的部分付款提供信用背书，确保Anthropic获得稳定的算力通道。此次融资刷新了全球芯片债务交易纪录，标志着大模型军备竞赛进入比拼底层算力资源与资本整合能力的新阶段。受此消息影响，博通盘后股价上涨1.9%，Alphabet股价上涨1.2%。该模式通过金融创新解决了AI企业对高性能算力的迫切需求，对行业基础设施建设具有重要示范意义。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌DeepMind CEO哈萨比斯预测AGI最快将于2029至2030年间实现</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/84449dc887a89f3a0bbb15a35f6a0730.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌DeepMind首席执行官德米斯·哈萨比斯近日公开表示，通用人工智能（AGI）的研发进程显著加速，预计最快在2029年至2030年间，即未来三年内即可实现具备人类同等智慧的AGI。哈萨比斯指出，当前多模态理解、自主决策及AI智能体等核心技术的快速成熟，正为AGI的到来奠定基础，AGI的演进将是一个持续升级的过程。与专用AI不同，AGI具备跨领域的学习、推理与创造能力，将彻底重塑生产力格局。哈萨比斯同时发出警示，随着AI系统自我优化与自主迭代能力的增强，全球社会在规则制定与防护机制方面的准备严重不足，人类应对AGI落地的窗口期已非常紧迫。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软拟于下周Build大会发布全新自研代码及多场景AI模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/0abdab7b4d7ad50812eef5efd682ce06.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软计划在下周旧金山Build开发者大会上，正式发布多款自研AI模型，旨在完善自有AI体系并降低对外部供应商的依赖。针对GitHub Copilot面临的市场竞争，微软将推出一款高性价比的代码专用模型，作为Claude Code的平价替代方案，以吸引价格敏感型开发者。此外，微软还将发布覆盖语音转写、逻辑推理、语音处理及图像生成等场景的系列模型，并通过Azure云平台向开发者开放采购。此前，微软GitHub Copilot及Microsoft 365 Copilot主要依赖OpenAI和Anthropic模型。随着与OpenAI协议条款的调整，微软正加速布局自研模型矩阵，意在通过降低内部运营成本，应对全球大模型市场从能力竞赛向成本与生态应用的战略转型。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">三菱日联金融集团向3.5万名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise并开启AI原生转型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/586ea7f7c8e46311aad7a53a6bebca82.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">三菱日联金融集团（MUFG）正式向旗下三菱日联银行约35,000名员工全面部署ChatGPT Enterprise，标志着该集团向“AI原生”企业转型。自2024年10月与OpenAI合作以来，MUFG通过全员培训及定制化GPT工作坊，助力员工在四个月内自主创建超1,800个“AI银行家”工具。在研究任务与简报准备等工作流中，该工具已使员工日常工作量减少20%至30%。此外，MUFG计划在数字银行品牌emutt中推出由AI驱动的“AI礼宾”服务及多资产咨询平台，实现24/7个性化金融服务。管理层表示，此举旨在通过AI优化运营效率，将节省的时间投入到客户拜访与决策审批等高价值业务中，重塑零售金融体验。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
